  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Capturing Eldrin Wellsprings"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "I've figured out a way that I can harness some of the power of the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Eldrin Wellsprings",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": "to improve yields from my Fume Filters. I need to be careful to only take small amounts, as the raw power would simply melt any kind of apparatus that would take more. \n\nThe secret is to use a lens that only refracts small amounts of power into a void dimension, which is needed to contain the raw power. This lens requires a very specific resonant structure to be built around it in order to support the magic.\n\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "I can check both my generation multiplier and available power in the Occulus.",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n\nI can build a structure I call the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Wellspring Prism",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " using chimerite sandstone, or chimerite stone. Either one will work.  The important parts are to "
        },
        {
          "text": "center it over top of the wellspring perfectly",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and to "
        },
        {
          "text": "use a lens that matches the wellspring type",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
